error[RB0115]: unknown machine `chld` to talk to
  --> RB0115-unknown-address.road:19:16
   |
19 |     on Go send chld.Stop
   |                ^^^^
   |
   = help: did you mean `child`?

error[RB0115]: `child` is not in scope here: it names the machine `M.Running` invokes
  --> RB0115-unknown-address.road:22:16
   |
22 |     on Go send child.Stop
   |                ^^^^^
   |
   = help: an `as` name is in scope only in the invoking state and the states inside it, while the child runs; move this into `M.Running`

error[RB0115]: unknown machine `nobody` to talk to
  --> RB0115-unknown-address.road:25:16
   |
25 |     entry send nobody.Stop
   |                ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name an invoked machine with `invoke Machine(…) as name`, or take a parameter of type `ref Machine`

error[RB0115]: `child` is not in scope here: it names the machine `M.Running` invokes
  --> RB0115-unknown-address.road:27:6
